{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "Browser Bridge · Agent 浏览器桥",
  "version": "1.3.4",
  "key": "",
  "description": "把已登录的 Chrome 交给 agent 操控：描述符定位、元素拾取、点击、输入、拖拽、截图、监听接口、取 Cookie。",
  "minimum_chrome_version": "116",

  "permissions": [
    "storage",
    "alarms",
    "tabs",
    "scripting",
    "cookies",
    "debugger",
    "webNavigation"
  ],

  "host_permissions": ["<all_urls>"],

  "background": {
    "service_worker": "src/sw/service-worker.js",
    "type": "module"
  },

  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "_note": "网络抓包层（含跨域 iframe），必须在 document_start 注入才能 hook 到所有 fetch/XHR",
      "matches": ["<all_urls>"],
      "js": ["src/content/net-hook.js"],
      "run_at": "document_start",
      "world": "MAIN",
      "all_frames": true,
      "match_about_blank": false
    },
    {
      "_note": "网络抓包的转发层（ISOLATED world，与 MAIN 的 net-hook 通过 window.postMessage 沟通）",
      "matches": ["<all_urls>"],
      "js": ["src/content/net-relay.js"],
      "run_at": "document_start",
      "all_frames": true
    },
    {
      "_note": "共享基础层：config / adapter / locator / actions 在每个 frame 各跑一份。adapter 直接读 document —— 跨域 iframe 内元素能定位的前提，是这层在这帧里有实例。",
      "matches": ["<all_urls>"],
      "js": [
        "src/content/config.js",
        "src/content/adapter.js",
        "src/content/locator.js",
        "src/content/actions.js"
      ],
      "run_at": "document_idle",
      "all_frames": true
    },
    {
      "_note": "拾取器：每帧各有一份本地 picker 实例。本地实例只监听自己这帧的鼠标/键盘事件（解决 iframe 内事件不到主文档的老问题）；会话状态由 SW 协调（sessionId 防串）。",
      "matches": ["<all_urls>"],
      "js": ["src/content/picker.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle",
      "all_frames": true
    },
    {
      "_note": "消息路由：**每一帧各跑一份**。它是 SW 指令的唯一收件口（MAP + onMessage），没有它 iframe 就收不到 query/click/type。v1.3.1 从 main.js 拆出来 —— 之前 main.js 只主文档注入，导致整片 iframe 不可用。",
      "matches": ["<all_urls>"],
      "js": ["src/content/router.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle",
      "all_frames": true
    },
    {
      "_note": "面板 + 入口：只主文档跑。BB 球是页面唯一视觉入口；main.js 里的面板挂载、保活也只在这跑一份（每帧都挂会冒出几十个球）。",
      "matches": ["<all_urls>"],
      "js": ["src/content/panel.js", "src/content/main.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle",
      "all_frames": false
    }
  ],

  "action": {
    "default_popup": "src/popup/index.html",
    "default_title": "Browser Bridge · 连接状态"
  },

  "icons": {
    "16": "icons/icon16.png",
    "48": "icons/icon48.png",
    "128": "icons/icon128.png"
  }
}